2. Copying with credit. You may copy, adapt or reuse parts of HD2Runtime's
   code or Findings in another project only if that project gives clear,
   visible credit where its users will see it (for example on its mod page,
   README or release notes), in a form such as:

       Uses code / research from HD2Runtime by SkyeShade
       https://github.com/SkyeShade/HD2Runtime

   Removing, hiding or replacing that credit ends your permission under this
   section.

3. Redistribution. You may not redistribute HD2Runtime itself, in whole or
